{"title":"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the operation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/c/79c1a5b49779b9e5d3978768f877fe527839ee30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\star y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"36\" height=\"12\" /> is defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/2/e92153c2bd6d034dd85c90980467dc5b7cd170dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\star y = (x+1)(y+1) - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"202\" height=\"18\" />, then which one of the following is FALSE?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/d/c2d4735f450d56b31a512c6150dab43786de9985.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ x \\star y = y\\star x  \\text{ for all real } x,y. \\\\ \\text{(B)} \\ x \\star (y + z) = ( x \\star y ) + (x \\star z)  \\text{ for all real } x,y, \\text{ and } z.\\\\ \\text{(C)} \\ (x-1) \\star (x+1) = (x \\star x) - 1 \\text{ for all real } x. \\\\ \\text{(D)} \\ x \\star 0 = x \\text{ for all real } x. \\\\ \\text{(E)} \\ x \\star (y \\star z) = (x \\star y) \\star z \\text{ for all real } x,y, \\text{ and } z.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"434\" height=\"97\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(A) is true because multiplication is commutative.\n</p><p>(B) is false because we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/c/d8cef92205eeb80a1a8c547adc7e2374facadf48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\star (y + z) = (x+1)(y+z+1) - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"279\" height=\"18\" /> and \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/3/4733aa383f0ee5373e2137c83de4577218997058.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\star y + x\\star z = (x+1)(y+1) - 1 + (x+1)(z+1) - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"425\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/d/bcda343787127d09974f1f0caf5fa61af7c3ed2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+1)(y+z+2) - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"173\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/2/292590a6ab6240ecbf0cfd7a321304416bdbf4a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+1)(y+z+1) - (x+1) - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"251\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/4/5d4affc77e2431cb0b9e24c077e2ed014bb7f80e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[(x+1)(y+z+1) - 1] + x,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"220\" height=\"18\" />\nwhich does not match with the previous expression.\n</p><p>(C) is true because \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/b/aebb879f0bc71dbfe6ed3a2df9b7b82fa6f967b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-1)\\star (x+1) = ((x-1)+1)((x+1)+1) - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"389\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/1/4f197c7e78299228936e0727f89f17232e84ab6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(x+2) - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/e/18e5d40305598821a1565c25292ba885f0e9a3af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + 2x - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/8/21847ce1f0085df81d9eab0b51d5d75cc6da3cbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[(x+1)^2 - 1] - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"135\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/8/8a8859904ea4509b0135f2ccd0e68b38e2f5fe05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x\\star x) - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" />\nfor all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>(D) is true because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/9/9c9f75e5ac82939fe77e2d3840c3ef0bf7335900.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\star 0 = (x+1)(0+1) - 1 = (x+1) - 1 = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"348\" height=\"18\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>(E) is true because multiplication is associative (and the plus-ones inside the parentheses and the minus-ones outside cancel out).\n</p><p>Therefore, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />, and we are done.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME\" title=\"1982 AHSME\">1982 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1982 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1982\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017173904\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 153/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2490/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 148/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3641/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.060      1 -total\n 57.30%    6.910      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 40.15%    4.842      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:19477:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017173904 and revision id 222787. Renderi